71ac4f48251f808ace37dd3b0839fb5eb8","file":"preprints/A-counterexample-to-Naimarks-problem-in-ZFC-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":10,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"f7461d29d70a862a7005d860f54eb572e787c8a3811d35be76f5600f95940cf0","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-counterexample-to-Naimarks-problem-in-ZFC-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:0a762601d38d5c14ffb59b01a3529b71ac4f48251f808ace37dd3b0839fb5eb8","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-counterexample-to-Naimarks-problem-in-ZFC-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L10"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{na:main}\nThere exists a unital infinite-dimensional simple complex $C^*$-algebra\n$A$ with a faithful tracial state such that all its nonzero irreducible\nrepresentations are unitarily equivalent. In particular, $A$ is not\nisomorphic to $K(H)$ for any complex Hilbert space $H$."}
